     "titulo": "Describing before interpreting",
     "texto": [
      "Name what is observable (shot, sound, rhythm) before inferring the effect. Attribute interpretations: **Dette kan framheve…**. If the scene doesn't confirm an explanation, use **kan tyde på** rather than stating it as a fact."
     ],
